[{"id":"rafaa-2-63-3","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i podigli smo","en":"and we raised"},{"bs":"i uzdigli smo ga","en":"and We raised him"},{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"},{"bs":"podigao je","en":"he/it raised"}],"ref":"2:63","answerWord":"وَرَفَعْنَا","answerSound":"audio/d5e6bcb64c11ddee35f8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember, O Children of Israel) when We made a covenant with you and caused the mount to tower above you, (saying): Hold fast that which We have given you, and remember that which is therein, that ye may ward off (evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","أَخَذْنَا","مِيثَٰقَكُمْ","وَرَفَعْنَا","فَوْقَكُمُ","ٱلطُّورَ","خُذُوا۟","مَآ","ءَاتَيْنَٰكُم","بِقُوَّةٍ","وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","مَا","فِيهِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَتَّقُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-6-83-6","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podižemo","en":"we raise"},{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised him"},{"bs":"i podigao je","en":"and he/it raised"},{"bs":"podižete","en":"you (all) raise"}],"ref":"6:83","answerWord":"نَرْفَعُ","answerSound":"audio/01c3613c0a17021b41ad.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That is Our argument. We gave it unto Abraham against his folk. We raise unto degrees of wisdom whom We will. Lo! thy Lord is Wise, Aware.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَتِلْكَ","حُجَّتُنَآ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهَآ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","عَلَىٰ","قَوْمِهِۦ","نَرْفَعُ","دَرَجَٰتٍ","مَّن","نَّشَآءُ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","حَكِيمٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-79-28-0","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podigao je","en":"he/it raised"},{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised it"},{"bs":"podiže","en":"he/it raises"},{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"}],"ref":"79:28","answerWord":"رَفَعَ","answerSound":"audio/04895ca516a740fb62a8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He raised the height thereof and ordered it;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["رَفَعَ","سَمْكَهَا","فَسَوَّىٰهَا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-2-127-1","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podiže","en":"he/it raises"},{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"},{"bs":"podigao je","en":"he/it raised"},{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised him"}],"ref":"2:127","answerWord":"يَرْفَعُ","answerSound":"audio/f0f9fa7b2b46b7895dd3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when Abraham and Ishmael were raising the foundations of the House, (Abraham prayed): Our Lord! Accept from us (this duty). Lo! Thou, only Thou, art the Hearer, the Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","يَرْفَعُ","إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ","ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيْتِ","وَإِسْمَٰعِيلُ","رَبَّنَا","تَقَبَّلْ","مِنَّآ","إِنَّكَ","أَنتَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-4-158-1","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised him"},{"bs":"podižemo","en":"we raise"},{"bs":"podigao je","en":"he/it raised"},{"bs":"i uzdigli smo ga","en":"and We raised him"}],"ref":"4:158","answerWord":"رَّفَعَهُ","answerSound":"audio/5d5ae9eb70b166db243a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But Allah took him up unto Himself. Allah was ever Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["بَل","رَّفَعَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَيْهِ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَزِيزًا","حَكِيمًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-19-57-0","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"i uzdigli smo ga","en":"and We raised him"},{"bs":"podigao je","en":"he/it raised"},{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"},{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"}],"ref":"19:57","answerWord":"وَرَفَعْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/71135dd7dc77dd284038.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We raised him to high station.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَرَفَعْنَٰهُ","مَكَانًا","عَلِيًّا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-35-10-13","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"},{"bs":"i podigli smo","en":"and we raised"},{"bs":"podižete","en":"you (all) raise"},{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised it"}],"ref":"35:10","answerWord":"يَرْفَعُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/003d471560591e856b81.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso desireth power (should know that) all power belongeth to Allah. Unto Him good words ascend, and the pious deed doth He exalt; but those who plot iniquities, theirs will be an awful doom; and the plotting of such (folk) will come to naught.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["مَن","كَانَ","يُرِيدُ","ٱلْعِزَّةَ","فَلِلَّهِ","ٱلْعِزَّةُ","جَمِيعًا","إِلَيْهِ","يَصْعَدُ","ٱلْكَلِمُ","ٱلطَّيِّبُ","وَٱلْعَمَلُ","ٱلصَّٰلِحُ","يَرْفَعُهُۥ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَمْكُرُونَ","ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","لَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","شَدِيدٌ","وَمَكْرُ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","هُوَ","يَبُورُ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-49-2-4","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podižete","en":"you (all) raise"},{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"},{"bs":"podižemo","en":"we raise"},{"bs":"i uzdigli smo ga","en":"and We raised him"}],"ref":"49:2","answerWord":"تَرْفَعُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/92f0b7b70161bed6e00b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Lift not up your voices above the voice of the Prophet, nor shout when speaking to him as ye shout one to another, lest your works be rendered vain while ye perceive not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","لَا","تَرْفَعُوٓا۟","أَصْوَٰتَكُمْ","فَوْقَ","صَوْتِ","ٱلنَّبِىِّ","وَلَا","تَجْهَرُوا۟","لَهُۥ","بِٱلْقَوْلِ","كَجَهْرِ","بَعْضِكُمْ","لِبَعْضٍ","أَن","تَحْبَطَ","أَعْمَٰلُكُمْ","وَأَنتُمْ","لَا","تَشْعُرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-55-7-1","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised it"},{"bs":"podiže","en":"he/it raises"},{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"},{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"}],"ref":"55:7","answerWord":"رَفَعَهَا","answerSound":"audio/d4d6287cbc95ebd794a3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the sky He hath uplifted; and He hath set the measure,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَٱلسَّمَآءَ","رَفَعَهَا","وَوَضَعَ","ٱلْمِيزَانَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-58-11-17","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podiže","en":"he/it raises"},{"bs":"i uzdigli smo ga","en":"and We raised him"},{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"},{"bs":"podižete","en":"you (all) raise"}],"ref":"58:11","answerWord":"يَرْفَعِ","answerSound":"audio/aaf53425588051a119a1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! when it is said unto you, Make room! in assemblies, then make room; Allah will make way for you (hereafter). And when it is said, Come up higher! go up higher; Allah will exalt those who believe among you, and those who have knowledge, to high ranks. Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","قِيلَ","لَكُمْ","تَفَسَّحُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْمَجَٰلِسِ","فَٱفْسَحُوا۟","يَفْسَحِ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُمْ","وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","ٱنشُزُوا۟","فَٱنشُزُوا۟","يَرْفَعِ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","مِنكُمْ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْعِلْمَ","دَرَجَٰتٍ","وَٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"rafaa-88-18-3","words":["verb:rafaa"],"options":[{"bs":"podignuta je","en":"she/it was raised"},{"bs":"podigao ga je","en":"he/it raised it"},{"bs":"podiže ga","en":"he/it raises it"},{"bs":"podiže","en":"he/it raises"}],"ref":"88:18","answerWord":"رُفِعَتْ","answerSound":"audio/17f5c60db7d7c70d19ea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the heaven, how it is raised?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"podići, uzdići","en":"to raise, to lift"},"passage":["وَإِلَى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","كَيْفَ","رُفِعَتْ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"رَفَعَ"}},{"id":"gharra-45-35-6","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"i zavarala vas je","en":"and she/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"zavarava te","en":"he/it deceives you"},{"bs":"zavarao je","en":"he/it deceived"},{"bs":"i zavarala ih je","en":"and she/it deceived them"}],"ref":"45:35","answerWord":"وَغَرَّتْكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/e87544fb81843c4da1fb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"This, forasmuch as ye made the revelations of Allah a jest, and the life of the world beguiled you. Therefor this day they come not forth from thence, nor can they make amends.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكُم","بِأَنَّكُمُ","ٱتَّخَذْتُمْ","ءَايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","هُزُوًا","وَغَرَّتْكُمُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","فَٱلْيَوْمَ","لَا","يُخْرَجُونَ","مِنْهَا","وَلَا","هُمْ","يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"gharra-3-24-9","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"i zavarao ih je","en":"and he/it deceived them"},{"bs":"zavarava te","en":"he/it deceives you"},{"bs":"i zavarala vas je","en":"and she/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"i zavarao vas je","en":"and he/it deceived you (all)"}],"ref":"3:24","answerWord":"وَغَرَّهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/dc448957dacd48517fe9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That is because they say: The Fire will not touch us save for a certain number of days. That which they used to invent hath deceived them regarding their religion.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["ذَٰلِكَ","بِأَنَّهُمْ","قَالُوا۟","لَن","تَمَسَّنَا","ٱلنَّارُ","إِلَّآ","أَيَّامًا","مَّعْدُودَٰتٍ","وَغَرَّهُمْ","فِى","دِينِهِم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"gharra-3-196-1","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"neka te ne zavara","en":"let [it] not deceive you"},{"bs":"i zavarao ih je","en":"and he/it deceived them"},{"bs":"i zavarala vas je","en":"and she/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"i zavarala ih je","en":"and she/it deceived them"}],"ref":"3:196","answerWord":"يَغُرَّنَّكَ","answerSound":"audio/6a75123ca2806a523dcf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Let not the vicissitude (of the success) of those who disbelieve, in the land, deceive thee (O Muhammad).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["لَا","يَغُرَّنَّكَ","تَقَلُّبُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْبِلَٰدِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"gharra-8-49-7","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"zavarao je","en":"he/it deceived"},{"bs":"i zavarao vas je","en":"and he/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"i zavarala ih je","en":"and she/it deceived them"},{"bs":"zavarava te","en":"he/it deceives you"}],"ref":"8:49","answerWord":"غَرَّ","answerSound":"audio/64867c44f56c66914637.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the hypocrites and those in whose hearts is a disease said: Their religion hath deluded these. Whoso putteth his trust in Allah (will find that) lo! Allah is Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["إِذْ","يَقُولُ","ٱلْمُنَٰفِقُونَ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","فِى","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّرَضٌ","غَرَّ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","دِينُهُمْ","وَمَن","يَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَزِيزٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"gharra-40-4-9","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"zavarava te","en":"he/it deceives you"},{"bs":"i zavarala ih je","en":"and she/it deceived them"},{"bs":"i zavarao vas je","en":"and he/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"zavarao je","en":"he/it deceived"}],"ref":"40:4","answerWord":"يَغْرُرْكَ","answerSound":"audio/bb9983e4b237b087879d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"None argue concerning the revelations of Allah save those who disbelieve, so let not their turn of fortune in the land deceive thee (O Muhammad).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["مَا","يُجَٰدِلُ","فِىٓ","ءَايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","فَلَا","يَغْرُرْكَ","تَقَلُّبُهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْبِلَٰدِ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"gharra-57-14-17","words":["verb:gharra"],"options":[{"bs":"i zavarao vas je","en":"and he/it deceived you (all)"},{"bs":"i zavarao ih je","en":"and he/it deceived them"},{"bs":"zavarava te","en":"he/it deceives you"},{"bs":"i zavarala vas je","en":"and she/it deceived you (all)"}],"ref":"57:14","answerWord":"وَغَرَّكُم","answerSound":"audio/5f1c347e666a50ace054.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will cry unto them (saying): Were we not with you? They will say: Yea, verily; but ye tempted one another, and hesitated, and doubted, and vain desires beguiled you till the ordinance of Allah came to pass; and the deceiver deceived you concerning Allah;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zavarati, obmanuti","en":"to deceive, to delude"},"passage":["يُنَادُونَهُمْ","أَلَمْ","نَكُن","مَّعَكُمْ","قَالُوا۟","بَلَىٰ","وَلَٰكِنَّكُمْ","فَتَنتُمْ","أَنفُسَكُمْ","وَتَرَبَّصْتُمْ","وَٱرْتَبْتُمْ","وَغَرَّتْكُمُ","ٱلْأَمَانِىُّ","حَتَّىٰ","جَآءَ","أَمْرُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَغَرَّكُم","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْغَرُورُ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"غَرَّ"}},{"id":"awsa-19-31-5","words":["verb:awsa"],"options":[{"bs":"i naložio mi je","en":"and He enjoined me"},{"bs":"oporučujete","en":"you (all) bequeath"},{"bs":"oporučuje vam","en":"he/it enjoins you (all)"},{"bs":"oporučuje","en":"he/it bequeaths"}],"ref":"19:31","answerWord":"وَأَوْصَٰنِى","answerSound":"audio/e44eb8212abb3a21c963.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And hath made me blessed wheresoever I may be, and hath enjoined upon me prayer and almsgiving so long as I remain alive,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"naložiti, oporučiti","en":"to enjoin, to bequeath"},"passage":["وَجَعَلَنِى","مُبَارَكًا","أَيْنَ","مَا","كُنتُ","وَأَوْصَٰنِى","بِٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَٱلزَّكَوٰةِ","مَا","دُمْتُ","حَيًّا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَوْصَى"}}]